msgstr "通行密钥不在手边时，可以用 6 位验证码登录。验证码在所有地址都有效，所以面板换到新域名后也能用它登录。"

#. placeholder {0}: state.recoveryCodesLeft
msgid "Sign in with a 6-digit code when your passkey isn't at hand. {0} of 10 recovery codes are left."
msgstr "通行密钥不在手边时，可以用 6 位验证码登录。还剩 {0} 个恢复码（共 10 个）。"

msgid "Such as 1Password, Google Authenticator or Aegis"
msgstr "例如 1Password、Google Authenticator 或 Aegis"

msgid "Ten new codes replace the {left} you have now, and the old ones stop working at once. You see the new ones only once."
msgstr "10 个新恢复码将替换你现有的 {left} 个，旧的会立即失效。新的恢复码只显示一次。"

msgid "The authenticator app isn't set up yet"
msgstr "身份验证器应用尚未设置"

msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "关闭"

