msgstr "开启"

msgid "Claim it with a one-time link from {name}, such as the one the install printed. For a new link, run this on {name} over SSH:"
msgstr "用来自 {name} 的一次性链接认领它，例如安装结束时打印的那个。如需新链接，请通过 SSH 在 {name} 上运行："

msgid "No owner yet"
msgstr "还没有所有者"

msgid "{name} has no owner yet"
msgstr "{name} 还没有所有者"

