msgid "A rollback puts back its spec, not its data, so if a newer version changed that data, such as with a migration, the older one may not read it. Check before you apply, and restore a backup if it won't."
msgstr "回滚只恢复配置，不恢复数据。如果新版本改动过这些数据（例如迁移），旧版本可能无法读取。请在应用前检查，如无法读取，请恢复备份。"

msgid "A rollback puts back its spec, not its data, so if a newer version changed that data, such as with a migration, the older one may not read it. Check that it does, and restore a backup if it won't."
msgstr "回滚只恢复配置，不恢复数据。如果新版本改动过这些数据（例如迁移），旧版本可能无法读取。请检查能否读取，如无法读取，请恢复备份。"

msgid "A rollback puts back which variables and secrets it uses, not what they held then. To go back on a value, change it in Variables and secrets."
msgstr "回滚只恢复它使用哪些变量和密钥，不恢复当时的值。要改回某个值，请在“变量和密钥”中修改。"

msgid "Anyone who can reach this server gets it, around whatever is in front of it."
msgstr "任何能访问此服务器的人都能访问它，并绕过它前面的任何内容。"

msgid "Anyone who can read this app can see it. It can't be hidden there, so if it's a secret, set it in environment for the app to read instead."
msgstr "能读取此应用的任何人都能看到它。这里无法隐藏它，因此如果它是机密，请改为在 environment 中设置，让应用从那里读取。"

msgid "Anyone who can read this app can see it. Its value has a space, a quote or another character Compose reads as part of the line, so one name can't stand for it. To keep it hidden, write the {where} as a list, with each word its own variable."
msgstr "能读取此应用的任何人都能看到它。它的值含有空格、引号或 Compose 会当作这一行一部分来读的其他字符，所以一个名称无法代表它。要隐藏它，请把{where}写成列表，每个词使用各自的变量。"

msgid "Anyone who can read this app can see it. Only a variable's value is hidden, so don't write a secret in its name."
msgstr "能读取此应用的任何人都能看到它。只有变量的值会被隐藏，因此不要把机密写在变量名中。"

msgid "Check that you have another way in, such as your provider's console, before you apply it."
msgstr "应用前，请确认你还有其他登录途径，例如服务商的控制台。"

msgid "Dockwell didn't make that network, and it reaches past the server's firewall. Whatever else is on it, other projects' services too, can reach {name}, and it them."
msgstr "该网络不是 Dockwell 创建的，并且可以绕过服务器的防火墙。网络上的其他内容（包括其他项目的服务）都能访问 {name}，它也能访问它们。"

msgid "Dockwell didn't make that network. Whatever else is on it, other projects' services too, can reach {name}, and it them."
msgstr "该网络不是 Dockwell 创建的。网络上的其他内容（包括其他项目的服务）都能访问 {name}，它也能访问它们。"

msgid "Dockwell didn't make that volume, and won't delete it. Whatever else mounts it shares what it holds."
msgstr "该卷不是 Dockwell 创建的，Dockwell 也不会删除它。其他挂载它的容器会共享其中的内容。"

msgid "Everything in {name} on {server} goes back to what was there before the restore"
msgstr "{server} 上 {name} 的全部内容会回到恢复之前的状态"

msgid "Everything in {name} on {server} is replaced with the copy from {taken}"
msgstr "{server} 上 {name} 的全部内容会被替换为 {taken} 的副本"

